# 🚀 HYPERLIQUID BOT ON VPS - DEAD SIMPLE GUIDE

**Goal:** Get your bot running 24/7 on a cloud VPS in 15 minutes.

**Why VPS?** Your bot runs even if your laptop is off. Perfect for perpetual trading.

---

## PART 1: CHOOSE & SET UP YOUR VPS (5 minutes)

### Recommended VPS Providers

Pick ONE (all work equally fine):

| Provider | Price | Location | Why |
|----------|-------|----------|-----|
| **DigitalOcean** | $5/month | Global | Easiest, best docs |
| **Vultr** | $6/month | Global | Fast, reliable |
| **Linode** | $5/month | Global | Good support |
| **AWS** | $10/month | Global | Industry standard |
| **Hetzner** | €3/month | EU-based | Cheapest, solid |

**Recommendation:** Start with **DigitalOcean**. Easiest UX.

### Step 1: Create VPS Account

1. Go to https://www.digitalocean.com
2. Sign up (use email)
3. Add payment method (credit card)
4. Click **"Create"** → **"Droplets"**

### Step 2: Configure Your Droplet

**Size:** Pick the **$5/month (512 MB RAM)** option. That's plenty.

**OS:** Select **Ubuntu 22.04 LTS** (most stable)

**Region:** Pick closest to you (doesn't matter much)

**Authentication:** 
- [ ] **SSH Keys** (recommended, more secure)
- [ ] **Password** (easier for beginners)

→ **Choose Password for now** (we'll explain SSH later if needed)

**Finalize:** Click **"Create Droplet"**

Wait 30 seconds. You'll get an IP address like: `123.45.67.89`

