### On Mac/Linux:

```bash
ssh root@123.45.67.89
# Replace 123.45.67.89 with YOUR IP address
# It will ask: "Are you sure?" → Type: yes
# Password: Use the password from your email
```

### On Windows:

Download **PuTTY**: https://www.putty.org/

1. Launch PuTTY
2. Host Name: `123.45.67.89`
3. Click **"Open"**
4. Login: `root`
5. Password: Paste from email (right-click to paste)

