## PART 3: INSTALL EVERYTHING (5 minutes)

You're now inside your VPS terminal. Copy-paste these commands ONE AT A TIME:

### Step 1: Update System

```bash
apt update && apt upgrade -y
```

Wait for it to finish (1-2 minutes). Shows lots of text.

### Step 2: Install Python & Tools

```bash
apt install -y python3 python3-pip python3-venv git nano
```

This installs Python, pip (package manager), and git.

### Step 3: Create Bot Folder

```bash
mkdir -p /home/hyperliquid-bot
cd /home/hyperliquid-bot
```

---

## PART 4: COPY BOT FILES TO VPS (3 minutes)

You have two options:

### OPTION A: Upload Files Using SCP (Easiest)

**From your laptop (NOT in VPS terminal), open a NEW terminal:**

```bash
# Navigate to folder with your bot files
cd ~/your-bot-folder

# Copy all files to VPS
scp hyperliquid_trading_bot.py root@123.45.67.89:/home/hyperliquid-bot/
scp requirements.txt root@123.45.67.89:/home/hyperliquid-bot/
scp BOT_CONFIG_GUIDE.md root@123.45.67.89:/home/hyperliquid-bot/
scp QUICKSTART.md root@123.45.67.89:/home/hyperliquid-bot/
scp MACRO_DASHBOARD.md root@123.45.67.89:/home/hyperliquid-bot/
scp .env.example root@123.45.67.89:/home/hyperliquid-bot/

# Replace 123.45.67.89 with your actual IP
# It will ask for password → paste it
```

### OPTION B: Clone from GitHub (If Uploaded There)

**Back in VPS terminal:**

```bash
cd /home/hyperliquid-bot
git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/hyperliquid-bot.git .
# (only if you've pushed files to GitHub)
```

