## PART 10: TROUBLESHOOTING

### Bot Not Running?

```bash
# Check if process exists
ps aux | grep python

# Restart bot
screen -S hyperliquid -X quit
screen -S hyperliquid -d -m python3 hyperliquid_trading_bot.py
```

### Bot Crashed?

```bash
# Check recent logs
tail -100 /home/hyperliquid-bot/hyperliquid_bot.log | grep ERROR

# Restart
systemctl restart hyperliquid
```

### Out of Memory?

```bash
# Check memory usage
free -h

# If low, restart VPS
reboot
```

### VPS Disconnected?

That's fine. Bot keeps running. Just SSH back in when you reconnect.

