## SECURITY BEST PRACTICES

✅ **DO:**
- [ ] Use a strong VPS password (20+ chars, mixed case + numbers)
- [ ] Rotate API keys monthly
- [ ] Keep `.env` file private (never commit to git)
- [ ] Backup `.env` to encrypted drive
- [ ] Use SSH keys instead of passwords (later upgrade)
- [ ] Enable VPS firewall (only allow your IP)

❌ **DON'T:**
- [ ] Share your private key with ANYONE
- [ ] Upload `.env` to GitHub
- [ ] Use weak passwords
- [ ] Leave VPS idle without monitoring

